The reeds part like a bad zipper. Something the colour of old pennies regards you.
It is a Bog-Wretch. It has opinions about your posture.
"You read the omens," it gurgles. "Most people just step in me and apologise."
[A rare moment of clarity: you are, in fact, a player character. The Wretch knows. It will not bring it up again. Probably.]
"Catch me, or don't. The marsh keeps a ledger either way."
[You make a note. The Wretch makes a note. The ledger thickens.]
